
Property set operations.
USAGE:

SET <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

The following writeable properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
AutomaticResetBootOption           	boolean             	Read/Write
CurrentTimeZone                    	sint16              	Read/Write
EnableDaylightSavingsTime          	boolean             	Write     
Roles                              	string              	Read/Write
SystemStartupDelay                 	uint16              	Read/Write
SystemStartupOptions               	string              	Read/Write
SystemStartupSetting               	uint8               	Read/Write
Workgroup                          	string              	Read/Write

